lay mechanics and strategies. Each form brings different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level in Lirai has its own mysteries and puzzles designed to encourage the player to explore and think critically. The player will be tasked with complex puzzles to get through, uncover hidden secrets, and solve the story's puzzle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark with Brian on his journey as he explores through the story and in-game discoveries toward a quest to save humanity from abomination and extinction.</p></li></ul>",
