        "notes": "Lirai: An Intense Post-Apocalyptic Survival Game\r\n\r\nIn Lirai, players enter a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies in a third-person action game. It offers challenging combat and mature themes, without crossing into explicit content territory.\r\n\r\nAction and Combat: Players will engage in fast-paced, tactical combat with melee weapons, firearms, and environmental hazards. The game features depictions of injury and moderate gore.\r\n\r\nViolence and Battle:  While combat is central to the gameplay, the focus remains on action, with violence kept within appropriate bounds.\r\n\r\nFlashing Lights Warning: Some sequences feature flashing lights during high-energy moments. Players sensitive to flashing visuals should be cautious.\r\n\r\nNo Explicit Content: Lirai does not contain depictions of sexual assault, non-consensual acts, or drug or alcohol abuse. The game stays within clear, responsible boundaries for audiences.\r\n\r\nPlayer Advisory: It contains combat, violence, and survival themes that may not be suitable for younger players. Those sensitive to moderate blood and flashing lights should consider this before playing."
